<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:15.200" end="00:00:18.995" style="s2">Don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.200" end="00:00:21.015" style="s2">Please. He&#39;s never hurt anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.995" end="00:00:21.015" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.100" end="00:00:42.000" style="s2">Don&#39;t let them see your hands. Hide</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.900" end="00:00:42.000" style="s2">them. Always.</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.900" end="00:00:45.700" style="s2">Now close your eyes, little one. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.700" end="00:00:48.400" style="s2">look</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.700" end="00:00:48.400" style="s2">whatever you hear.</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.700" end="00:00:57.600" style="s2">No. No, stay with me. Look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.100" end="00:01:25.600" style="s2">It&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.000" end="00:01:25.600" style="s2">It&#39;s still me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.600" end="00:01:56.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama?</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.792" end="00:02:17.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sheriff, don&#39;t remind State Rick.</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.692" end="00:02:18.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. If he eats us, we don&#39;t have to</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.492" end="00:02:21.492" style="s2">come back tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.392" end="00:02:21.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tamsin, shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.791" end="00:02:24.811" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.341" end="00:02:31.361" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.576" end="00:02:55.596" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.392" end="00:02:59.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morning to you too, big guy.</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.467" end="00:03:20.487" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.492" end="00:03:27.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t stare at that thing. They notice</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.392" end="00:03:27.092" style="s2">who stares.</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.462" end="00:03:41.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.992" end="00:03:42.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You smell like a fire pit. They throw</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.392" end="00:03:46.492" style="s2">you again?</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.892" end="00:03:46.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only a little wick. I bounced.</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.492" end="00:04:05.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They raised the rent the forge.</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.494" end="00:04:05.894" style="s2">Again.</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.294" end="00:04:11.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The wells never go cold, neither does</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.594" end="00:04:11.094" style="s2">what we owe.</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.994" end="00:04:19.294" style="s2">That&#39;s the scavenger hook. I know that</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.594" end="00:04:21.094" style="s2">sound.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.294" end="00:04:22.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Salvage crews pay double this week. One</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.094" end="00:04:24.594" style="s2">night in Ashfin and we&#39;re fine till</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.294" end="00:04:24.594" style="s2">spring.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.994" end="00:04:28.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ashfin took your mother, Tam.</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.594" end="00:04:31.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not her.</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.794" end="00:04:31.394" style="s2">I&#39;ll be careful.</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.894" end="00:04:37.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Careful.</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.194" end="00:04:37.394" style="s2">That&#39;s what she said, too.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.498" end="00:05:48.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.594" end="00:06:06.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s her mark.</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.894" end="00:06:06.495" style="s2">That&#39;s mama&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.995" end="00:06:12.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lights out, now.</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.495" end="00:06:36.495" style="s2">CHANCEY, LEAVE IT. RUN!</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.095" end="00:07:13.195" style="s2">RUN!</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.645" end="00:07:32.665" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.495" end="00:07:48.995" style="s2">Why didn&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.565" end="00:08:14.585" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.097" end="00:08:25.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re warm out here.</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.097" end="00:08:25.097" style="s2">How are you still warm?</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.420" end="00:08:41.697" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.097" end="00:08:43.097" style="s2">He went back for you. You were digging</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.697" end="00:08:45.316" style="s2">in a dead dragon&#39;s skull and he went</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.097" end="00:08:47.336" style="s2">back for you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.316" end="00:08:47.336" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.797" end="00:08:56.397" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:09:02.497" end="00:09:07.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are YOU DOING?</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.497" end="00:09:07.397" style="s2">RAOUL, RAOUL.</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.066" end="00:09:21.396" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.376" end="00:09:21.396" style="s2">[sighs and panting]</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.996" end="00:09:24.016" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.397" end="00:09:35.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SHH, SHH.</p>
<p begin="00:10:06.697" end="00:10:10.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT&#39;S KNOCKING IS AT THE FLOOR.</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.397" end="00:10:14.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; RATS. Big rats. Go back to sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.098" end="00:10:22.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wretch, don&#39;t knock, Tam.</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.598" end="00:10:24.932" style="s2">What did you bring into my house?</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.912" end="00:10:24.932" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.117" end="00:10:32.137" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.562" end="00:10:48.598" style="s2">[snorts] Burnt shell. That smell.</p>
<p begin="00:10:45.498" end="00:10:48.598" style="s2">Tam, that&#39;s a dragon.</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.698" end="00:10:59.398" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.798" end="00:10:59.398" style="s2">What is it?</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.698" end="00:11:15.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It hurts when you hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.698" end="00:11:29.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Close your hand. Close it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.798" end="00:11:39.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t let them see your hands.</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.798" end="00:11:42.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did you hear that?</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.398" end="00:11:44.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She said it</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.698" end="00:11:47.098" style="s2">the night they took her.</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.298" end="00:11:47.098" style="s2">I was six.</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.338" end="00:11:53.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.098" end="00:12:08.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hatchlings get killed in this city, Tam.</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.298" end="00:12:11.098" style="s2">So do the people who hide them.</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.098" end="00:12:11.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then nobody finds out.</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.399" end="00:12:17.099" style="s2">He&#39;s eating the coal.</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.883" end="00:12:19.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.099" end="00:12:21.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course he is. Fire&#39;s food.</p>
<p begin="00:12:19.503" end="00:12:21.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.499" end="00:12:47.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll keep you safe</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.299" end="00:12:47.799" style="s2">always.</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.699" end="00:13:34.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A bond has been born tonight</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.499" end="00:13:34.499" style="s2">in my city.</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.599" end="00:13:41.499" style="s2">You doubt me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.199" end="00:13:52.299" style="s2">I feel every one of them right here like</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.599" end="00:13:54.799" style="s2">a burn that won&#39;t heal.</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.299" end="00:13:57.199" style="s2">The last one took me 15 years to put</p>
<p begin="00:13:54.799" end="00:13:57.199" style="s2">down.</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.899" end="00:14:09.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A bonded dragon bleeds for a human,</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.599" end="00:14:09.099" style="s2">fights for a human, kneels for one.</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.999" end="00:14:14.399" style="s2">Give them one bonded dragon and they&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.099" end="00:14:17.301" style="s2">want a thousand. They&#39;ll ride us into</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.399" end="00:14:18.801" style="s2">every war they start.</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.301" end="00:14:21.601" style="s2">Wake the hunters,</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.801" end="00:14:24.201" style="s2">search the human forth, every forge,</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.601" end="00:14:24.201" style="s2">every cellar.</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.101" end="00:14:36.455" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Find the human.</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.435" end="00:14:36.455" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.701" end="00:14:44.101" style="s2">Bring me its hands.</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.325" end="00:15:01.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.840" end="00:15:10.201" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.001" end="00:15:12.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s my only pair, you little ash rat.</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.201" end="00:15:15.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It needs a name. You can&#39;t yell hey you</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.501" end="00:15:15.201" style="s2">at a dragon.</p>
<p begin="00:15:17.010" end="00:15:19.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.301" end="00:15:22.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Orith.</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.601" end="00:15:23.301" style="s2">Grandma&#39;s word for ember. Orith.</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.001" end="00:15:27.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm. [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.301" end="00:15:27.301" style="s2">You name it, you keep it. Remember that.</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.301" end="00:15:42.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Burns can hide marks. Take him anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.701" end="00:15:47.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re taking anyone with a bandage</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.001" end="00:15:49.901" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.001" end="00:15:51.701" style="s2">Kesh wants hands. He doesn&#39;t care whose.</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.901" end="00:15:54.345" style="s2">A bandage gets you looked at. A bare</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.701" end="00:15:56.365" style="s2">hand gets you killed.</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.345" end="00:15:56.365" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.001" end="00:16:14.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is he</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.901" end="00:16:16.101" style="s2">bigger?</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.401" end="00:16:18.602" style="s2">He&#39;s bigger than yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.101" end="00:16:20.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Feed it fire, it grows. That&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.602" end="00:16:22.202" style="s2">trouble with dragons.</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.302" end="00:16:25.502" style="s2">Fire makes them big.</p>
<p begin="00:16:22.202" end="00:16:25.502" style="s2">Big makes them hard to hide.</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.902" end="00:16:37.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Up.</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.802" end="00:16:37.802" style="s2">Up. You&#39;ve got wings. Use them.</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.002" end="00:16:57.602" style="s2">Our secret. Please.</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.902" end="00:17:17.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You wrist. You never wrist. What</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.902" end="00:17:17.302" style="s2">happened?</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.102" end="00:17:25.002" style="s2">Whatever hurts him marks you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:23.502" end="00:17:27.802" style="s2">Every scratch.</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.002" end="00:17:27.802" style="s2">Every time.</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.902" end="00:17:35.202" style="s2">Give me your hand.</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.502" end="00:17:35.202" style="s2">The marked one.</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.302" end="00:17:48.502" style="s2">Ellayne had this mark.</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.202" end="00:17:51.302" style="s2">Right here.</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.502" end="00:17:51.302" style="s2">Same hand.</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.202" end="00:18:00.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mother was bonded.</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.002" end="00:18:00.002" style="s2">You never told me that.</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.102" end="00:18:03.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were six.</p>
<p begin="00:18:01.502" end="00:18:04.902" style="s2">What was I supposed to tell you?</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.402" end="00:18:06.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The truth.</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.902" end="00:18:08.702" style="s2">A monster took her. That&#39;s what everyone</p>
<p begin="00:18:06.402" end="00:18:08.702" style="s2">said.</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.902" end="00:18:12.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s what they told you. That&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.902" end="00:18:14.102" style="s2">the same thing.</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.702" end="00:18:16.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s they?</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.102" end="00:18:16.702" style="s2">What do you know?</p>
<p begin="00:18:17.202" end="00:18:23.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know people who ask that question end</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.102" end="00:18:23.503" style="s2">up on a list. Go to sleep, Tam.</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.103" end="00:18:49.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This was hers.</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.803" end="00:18:49.803" style="s2">This was her dragon&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.918" end="00:19:08.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.638" end="00:19:24.658" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.603" end="00:19:33.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hands, everyone. Palms up.</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.303" end="00:19:49.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s fresh.</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.503" end="00:19:49.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scale knife. Occupational hazard.</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.803" end="00:20:05.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m old, captain. Take me and be done</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.103" end="00:20:05.403" style="s2">with it.</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.003" end="00:20:14.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rapid.</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.203" end="00:20:17.003" style="s2">Infection kills more scrappers than</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.403" end="00:20:17.003" style="s2">dragons do.</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.174" end="00:20:28.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.309" end="00:20:39.329" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.405" end="00:20:53.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chimney, now go.</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.205" end="00:21:06.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If that thing pisses on my step, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.205" end="00:21:10.605" style="s2">cleaning it, soldier.</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.505" end="00:21:10.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Captain, the hound wants inside.</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.194" end="00:21:23.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.605" end="00:21:35.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a chimney.</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.905" end="00:21:38.405" style="s2">It&#39;s full of soot and dead birds. Want</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.005" end="00:21:38.405" style="s2">me to light it so you can see better?</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.405" end="00:21:47.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A blind smith.</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.805" end="00:21:49.405" style="s2">Good cover for a lot of things.</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.905" end="00:21:51.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good cover for walking into walls,</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.405" end="00:21:51.805" style="s2">mostly.</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.805" end="00:21:58.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep that hand clean, Scraper.</p>
<p begin="00:22:01.805" end="00:22:06.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Old coal cellar. Nobody&#39;s opened it in</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.105" end="00:22:06.805" style="s2">20 years.</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.405" end="00:22:21.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Down here, no chimneys, no goats, no</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.305" end="00:22:23.905" style="s2">flying.</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.905" end="00:22:27.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That captain will be back.</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.905" end="00:22:27.506" style="s2">His kind always come back.</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.206" end="00:22:48.106" style="s2">A smith who lets his forge grow cold at</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.906" end="00:22:49.306" style="s2">night</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.106" end="00:22:51.906" style="s2">watch the door</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.306" end="00:22:51.906" style="s2">every night.</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.476" end="00:23:19.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.786" end="00:23:19.806" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.606" end="00:23:40.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.706" end="00:23:41.406" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.106" end="00:23:44.406" style="s2">Let me see.</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.406" end="00:23:44.406" style="s2">I know I feel it too.</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.706" end="00:23:58.006" style="s2">Hold still, please.</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.507" end="00:24:46.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I took it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.307" end="00:24:46.107" style="s2">I took your burn.</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.307" end="00:25:00.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Smoke, burnt straw, burnt skin.</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.007" end="00:25:00.408" style="s2">Tam?</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.507" end="00:25:06.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His wing was burned, bad. I put my hand</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.107" end="00:25:06.908" style="s2">on it and it came to me, all of it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.137" end="00:25:11.157" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.908" end="00:25:17.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve never heard of that.</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.707" end="00:25:18.807" style="s2">Not even from her.</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.607" end="00:25:20.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then maybe she didn&#39;t know everything</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.807" end="00:25:21.408" style="s2">either.</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.007" end="00:25:22.237" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Or she knew.</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.408" end="00:25:24.607" style="s2">And it&#39;s why they came for</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.237" end="00:25:24.607" style="s2">[clears throat] her.</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.408" end="00:25:38.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t. It&#39;s fine.</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.707" end="00:25:38.607" style="s2">Better me than you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.307" end="00:26:09.908" style="s2">That was a week of coal.</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.007" end="00:26:09.908" style="s2">A week or a</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.908" end="00:26:26.408" style="s2">Head down.</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.207" end="00:26:26.408" style="s2">You&#39;re too big for this house now.</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.428" end="00:26:28.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.978" end="00:26:34.998" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.409" end="00:26:52.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh no.</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.309" end="00:26:52.109" style="s2">Oh no, no, no.</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.409" end="00:27:03.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Door.</p>
<p begin="00:27:00.709" end="00:27:03.109" style="s2">Now.</p>
<p begin="00:27:08.709" end="00:27:13.588" style="s2">This</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.209" end="00:27:15.608" style="s2">is my house.</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.588" end="00:27:15.608" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.758" end="00:27:24.778" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.963" end="00:27:33.294" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.273" end="00:27:33.294" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.109" end="00:27:42.409" style="s2">TOM.</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.309" end="00:27:45.749" style="s2">TOM.</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.409" end="00:27:45.749" style="s2">DON&#39;T YOU DARE COME UP HERE. [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.339" end="00:27:48.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.819" end="00:27:58.839" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.009" end="00:28:07.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A BONDED HATCHLING</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.209" end="00:28:07.009" style="s2">IN A COAL CELLAR.</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.109" end="00:28:12.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET HIM GO.</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.909" end="00:28:12.409" style="s2">Wick&#39;s blind. He didn&#39;t know anything.</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.409" end="00:28:18.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put the knife down. Come quietly. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.509" end="00:28:18.409" style="s2">the only way he lives.</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.709" end="00:28:41.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GO.</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.910" end="00:28:41.310" style="s2">AND DON&#39;T YOU DARE COME BACK FOR ME.</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.310" end="00:28:48.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; UP.</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.110" end="00:28:48.910" style="s2">ORIS, UP.</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.910" end="00:29:17.410" style="s2">You can do this. You can. Please.</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.710" end="00:29:48.910" style="s2">Down. Get low.</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.065" end="00:29:56.085" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.510" end="00:30:16.010" style="s2">Fire. Of course. You&#39;re eating the air.</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.126" end="00:30:30.801" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.781" end="00:30:30.801" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.331" end="00:30:37.351" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.310" end="00:30:42.912" style="s2">Into the fog.</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.712" end="00:30:42.912" style="s2">They won&#39;t follow us in there.</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.501" end="00:30:46.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.841" end="00:31:04.312" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.496" end="00:31:05.612" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.312" end="00:31:06.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy.</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.612" end="00:31:08.512" style="s2">Easy.</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.912" end="00:31:11.312" style="s2">I know.</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.512" end="00:31:11.312" style="s2">Nobody goes in there.</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.212" end="00:31:38.812" style="s2">She bleeds where it bleeds, just like</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.212" end="00:31:38.812" style="s2">the stories.</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.512" end="00:32:02.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A blind man</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.312" end="00:32:05.067" style="s2">hiding a bonded hatchling. Brave.</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.412" end="00:32:07.087" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Old. Old is what I am.</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.067" end="00:32:07.087" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.512" end="00:32:13.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You smell of her mother too.</p>
<p begin="00:32:09.812" end="00:32:13.112" style="s2">You knew Elvine.</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.212" end="00:32:19.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep him alive. She&#39;ll come back for the</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.912" end="00:32:19.712" style="s2">old man.</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.817" end="00:32:39.782" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cough]</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.127" end="00:32:41.802" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.782" end="00:32:41.802" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:33:01.397" end="00:33:03.417" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.913" end="00:33:09.967" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We made it. You flew. You actually flew.</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.947" end="00:33:09.967" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.152" end="00:33:17.172" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.213" end="00:33:27.513" style="s2">You told me not to come back.</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.313" end="00:33:29.913" style="s2">He always says the opposite of what he</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.513" end="00:33:29.913" style="s2">means.</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.493" end="00:33:35.513" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.113" end="00:33:39.413" style="s2">I&#39;m getting him out.</p>
<p begin="00:33:37.713" end="00:33:41.913" style="s2">I don&#39;t know how yet,</p>
<p begin="00:33:39.413" end="00:33:41.913" style="s2">but I am.</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.693" end="00:34:01.713" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.713" end="00:34:19.113" style="s2">Stay behind me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.413" end="00:34:19.113" style="s2">Don&#39;t argue.</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.203" end="00:34:29.223" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.113" end="00:34:35.013" style="s2">Like last time,</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.613" end="00:34:38.313" style="s2">it stopped.</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.013" end="00:34:38.313" style="s2">It smelled this and it stopped.</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.304" end="00:34:42.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.214" end="00:35:12.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you doing that?</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.914" end="00:35:12.514" style="s2">What are you?</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.119" end="00:35:30.139" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.699" end="00:35:53.719" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.014" end="00:36:05.114" style="s2">Grave mouth.</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.314" end="00:36:07.714" style="s2">You&#39;re the one from the stories.</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.114" end="00:36:07.714" style="s2">The one that took</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.214" end="00:36:43.514" style="s2">It knew you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:40.114" end="00:36:43.514" style="s2">I don&#39;t know how, but it knew you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.580" end="00:36:56.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.745" end="00:37:24.765" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.216" end="00:37:28.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You smell like goat.</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.216" end="00:37:32.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.416" end="00:37:33.316" style="s2">talk.</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.516" end="00:37:37.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm.</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.316" end="00:37:39.176" style="s2">And you state the obvious. Wonderful.</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.156" end="00:37:39.176" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.716" end="00:37:49.516" style="s2">A bond out here. Well,</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.116" end="00:37:49.516" style="s2">Kesh will be furious.</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.916" end="00:37:58.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you taking us?</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.116" end="00:38:03.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Somewhere the Blight don&#39;t nest and Kesh</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.716" end="00:38:03.116" style="s2">doesn&#39;t look. Stop wriggling.</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.316" end="00:38:20.616" style="s2">Put that down before you hurt yourself</p>
<p begin="00:38:18.216" end="00:38:21.716" style="s2">or him. Same thing now.</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.616" end="00:38:24.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.716" end="00:38:25.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sayle, once of the Council, now of this</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.516" end="00:38:26.916" style="s2">cave.</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.516" end="00:38:30.016" style="s2">And you are?</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.916" end="00:38:32.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tamsin, scale scraper of a forge with no</p>
<p begin="00:38:30.016" end="00:38:32.316" style="s2">roof.</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.616" end="00:38:40.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If he bites my tail, I&#39;m eating him.</p>
<p begin="00:38:38.316" end="00:38:42.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He won&#39;t. Orax,</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.016" end="00:38:42.416" style="s2">don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.516" end="00:38:48.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your hand.</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.817" end="00:38:48.317" style="s2">Open it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.017" end="00:38:56.117" style="s2">What cuts one marks the other. You&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.017" end="00:38:58.217" style="s2">noticed.</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.117" end="00:38:59.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every bruise, every burn, like he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.217" end="00:39:01.217" style="s2">wearing my skin.</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.317" end="00:39:03.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Or you&#39;re wearing his.</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.217" end="00:39:06.117" style="s2">That&#39;s the first law of the bond.</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.717" end="00:39:09.017" style="s2">There are three.</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.117" end="00:39:09.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tell me all three.</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.117" end="00:39:15.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Second law.</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.717" end="00:39:16.517" style="s2">If the bond is cut, the dragon loses its</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.417" end="00:39:17.617" style="s2">mind.</p>
<p begin="00:39:16.517" end="00:39:20.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cut how?</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.617" end="00:39:22.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The human dies or someone drives black</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.417" end="00:39:24.617" style="s2">iron into the dragon. Either way, the</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.917" end="00:39:27.717" style="s2">bond snaps.</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.617" end="00:39:29.417" style="s2">The eyes go black, the scales go dark.</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.717" end="00:39:30.617" style="s2">It turns into the things you met last</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.417" end="00:39:32.317" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.617" end="00:39:35.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The blight.</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.317" end="00:39:35.317" style="s2">The blight were dragons.</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.417" end="00:39:40.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A blight wears a black scar exactly</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.117" end="00:39:42.917" style="s2">where its bond was cut.</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.117" end="00:39:42.917" style="s2">Remember that.</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.717" end="00:39:47.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He burned his wing. I put my hand on it</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.717" end="00:39:49.417" style="s2">and the burn came to me. His wing</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.217" end="00:39:50.717" style="s2">healed.</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.417" end="00:39:53.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Third law.</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.717" end="00:39:54.817" style="s2">A wound shared is half a wound.</p>
<p begin="00:39:53.417" end="00:39:58.017" style="s2">One of you can pull the other&#39;s wound</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.817" end="00:39:59.217" style="s2">across, but both of you have to want it.</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.017" end="00:40:01.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the egg?</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.217" end="00:40:02.017" style="s2">It sat in a swamp for years. Why did it</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.017" end="00:40:03.617" style="s2">hatch for me?</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.017" end="00:40:06.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A dragon egg can sleep for a hundred</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.617" end="00:40:07.717" style="s2">years. It only wakes for bonded blood.</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.217" end="00:40:11.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wasn&#39;t bonded before it hatched.</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.717" end="00:40:14.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, but someone in your blood was.</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.517" end="00:40:16.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mother, Elara Vane. She was bonded.</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.017" end="00:40:16.517" style="s2">Did you know her?</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.717" end="00:40:24.717" style="s2">Who gave you that?</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.517" end="00:40:27.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It fell the night she was taken. I was</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.717" end="00:40:27.017" style="s2">six.</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.417" end="00:40:38.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know something. Say it.</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.217" end="00:40:38.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not today. Today you eat and he heals.</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.417" end="00:40:53.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.173" end="00:41:04.193" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:41:04.518" end="00:41:09.018" style="s2">Told you I&#39;d eat him. I&#39;m being</p>
<p begin="00:41:06.418" end="00:41:09.018" style="s2">generous.</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.318" end="00:41:21.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He grows every time he eats fire.</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.418" end="00:41:23.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fire is how we grow.</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.818" end="00:41:26.318" style="s2">Slowly is best.</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.818" end="00:41:27.118" style="s2">Too much at once and it nearly kills</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.318" end="00:41:29.118" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.118" end="00:41:31.718" style="s2">But you come out of it bigger than you</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.118" end="00:41:31.718" style="s2">went in.</p>
<p begin="00:41:35.618" end="00:41:40.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s new.</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.518" end="00:41:40.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s adolescence.</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.918" end="00:41:46.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your eye,</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.918" end="00:41:46.518" style="s2">who did that?</p>
<p begin="00:41:46.618" end="00:41:49.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kesh,</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.918" end="00:41:51.918" style="s2">the High Warden,</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.318" end="00:41:53.618" style="s2">the biggest dragon you&#39;ll ever see.</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.918" end="00:41:56.018" style="s2">He ordered the clurring.</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.618" end="00:41:57.018" style="s2">Every bonded pair hunted down. I said</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.018" end="00:42:00.618" style="s2">no.</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.018" end="00:42:00.618" style="s2">He took the eye that wouldn&#39;t look away.</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.124" end="00:42:04.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.618" end="00:42:06.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The clurring, is it still happening?</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.018" end="00:42:09.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kesh never stops anything.</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.318" end="00:42:09.918" style="s2">He just stops talking about it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.918" end="00:42:17.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.618" end="00:42:17.018" style="s2">Why does he hate the bond that much?</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.718" end="00:42:24.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kesh wasn&#39;t always like this.</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.318" end="00:42:27.218" style="s2">That&#39;s his story to tell</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.318" end="00:42:27.218" style="s2">if he ever tells it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.718" end="00:42:32.218" style="s2">Sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:42:30.018" end="00:42:33.918" style="s2">Tomorrow you learn to fly properly</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.218" end="00:42:36.518" style="s2">before something less polite than me</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.918" end="00:42:36.518" style="s2">finds you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.319" end="00:42:48.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.018" end="00:42:50.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eyes open.</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.518" end="00:42:52.214" style="s2">He can&#39;t see what you&#39;re afraid of if</p>
<p begin="00:42:50.318" end="00:42:54.234" style="s2">you won&#39;t look at it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.214" end="00:42:54.234" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.920" end="00:43:04.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He feels where I&#39;m leaning</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.720" end="00:43:09.420" style="s2">before I do it.</p>
<p begin="00:43:04.920" end="00:43:09.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course he does. He&#39;s half of you.</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.320" end="00:43:18.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Follow me through. Don&#39;t touch the</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.120" end="00:43:18.720" style="s2">bones.</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.690" end="00:43:23.710" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.620" end="00:43:30.120" style="s2">Woo.</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.520" end="00:43:32.620" style="s2">Ow. Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.120" end="00:43:35.220" style="s2">Okay, that one was you.</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.620" end="00:43:35.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Again.</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.320" end="00:43:53.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not terrible.</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.120" end="00:43:55.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the nicest thing you&#39;ve ever said</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.320" end="00:43:55.720" style="s2">to me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.720" end="00:44:04.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Execution horn.</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.620" end="00:44:04.320" style="s2">Another marked hand on the cliff.</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.220" end="00:44:10.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not him.</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.120" end="00:44:10.120" style="s2">Please, not him.</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.920" end="00:44:33.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These don&#39;t know you.</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.020" end="00:44:33.920" style="s2">FIGHT THEM.</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.420" end="00:44:50.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YES.</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.120" end="00:44:50.620" style="s2">AGAIN.</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.390" end="00:44:55.411" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.491" end="00:45:08.511" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.591" end="00:45:21.611" style="s2">[panting and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.821" end="00:45:30.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THAT&#39;S DEEP</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.321" end="00:45:32.621" style="s2">ON BOTH OF YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.721" end="00:45:36.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HE CAN&#39;T fly on that.</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.621" end="00:45:36.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then don&#39;t let him carry it alone.</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.221" end="00:45:51.021" style="s2">Half and half.</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.721" end="00:45:51.021" style="s2">You and me. Okay?</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.521" end="00:46:11.721" style="s2">We match.</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.721" end="00:46:13.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your mother did that once</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.721" end="00:46:14.121" style="s2">in front of me.</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.021" end="00:46:15.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You saw her?</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.121" end="00:46:17.021" style="s2">You saw her do this?</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.521" end="00:46:19.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On a battlefield.</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.021" end="00:46:20.821" style="s2">She took a spear wound off her dragon so</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.021" end="00:46:22.321" style="s2">he could keep flying.</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.821" end="00:46:24.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you knew her.</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.321" end="00:46:26.321" style="s2">You&#39;ve known since you saw the scale.</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.121" end="00:46:28.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew a lot of people.</p>
<p begin="00:46:26.321" end="00:46:30.421" style="s2">Most of them are scars now.</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.521" end="00:46:31.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop doing that. Stop knowing things and</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.421" end="00:46:33.121" style="s2">not saying them.</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.642" end="00:46:34.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.121" end="00:46:37.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Walk with me. There&#39;s something you</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.921" end="00:46:37.821" style="s2">should see first.</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.432" end="00:46:45.452" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.947" end="00:46:53.967" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.921" end="00:46:58.122" style="s2">Look at throat.</p>
<p begin="00:47:19.723" end="00:47:22.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Its eyes are grey. Why are its eyes</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.122" end="00:47:23.823" style="s2">grey?</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.223" end="00:47:26.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grey eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.823" end="00:47:30.122" style="s2">It&#39;s human still alive somewhere.</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.122" end="00:47:30.122" style="s2">The bonds cut, but not all the way.</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.523" end="00:47:39.922" style="s2">It walks toward the city every night</p>
<p begin="00:47:35.723" end="00:47:39.922" style="s2">looking for a face it can&#39;t remember.</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.422" end="00:47:45.323" style="s2">Remember the second law. The scar sits</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.723" end="00:47:47.422" style="s2">exactly where the bond was cut. Throat.</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.323" end="00:47:48.622" style="s2">Somebody cut that bond at the throat</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.422" end="00:47:49.922" style="s2">with black iron.</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.622" end="00:47:51.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Black iron.</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.922" end="00:47:54.823" style="s2">Soldiers carry black spears. In the city</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.922" end="00:47:54.823" style="s2">everyone&#39;s seen them.</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.323" end="00:48:00.422" style="s2">So the monsters out here.</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.122" end="00:48:01.922" style="s2">The city made them.</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.422" end="00:48:04.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Some of them.</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.922" end="00:48:04.523" style="s2">Enough of them.</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.622" end="00:48:16.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The big one.</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.223" end="00:48:19.523" style="s2">Grave Mac.</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.523" end="00:48:19.523" style="s2">Its scar was here.</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.023" end="00:48:25.523" style="s2">Right through the chest</p>
<p begin="00:48:22.823" end="00:48:25.523" style="s2">like a spear.</p>
<p begin="00:48:29.523" end="00:48:32.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tonight</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.723" end="00:48:34.223" style="s2">in the cave,</p>
<p begin="00:48:32.122" end="00:48:36.622" style="s2">not out here.</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.223" end="00:48:36.622" style="s2">I know.</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.223" end="00:48:49.122" style="s2">One night</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.523" end="00:48:49.122" style="s2">then we go home.</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.323" end="00:48:51.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Captain, nobody hunts in Ashfen at</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.723" end="00:48:55.223" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.823" end="00:48:55.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which is exactly why she&#39;s here.</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.084" end="00:49:16.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.048" end="00:49:19.379" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.124" end="00:49:19.379" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CIRCLE, BACK TO BACK. [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.629" end="00:49:41.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.024" end="00:50:04.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SORRY, MARA.</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.624" end="00:50:04.324" style="s2">TOOK ME TOO LONG.</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.324" end="00:50:21.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s him, the captain, the one who</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.224" end="00:50:25.624" style="s2">took Wick.</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.324" end="00:50:25.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then leave them. They came to hunt you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.624" end="00:50:31.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He wrapped my hand. He didn&#39;t have to.</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.224" end="00:50:34.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tamsin,</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.524" end="00:50:34.024" style="s2">don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.924" end="00:51:00.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Paul, when I lift, PULL YOUR LEG OUT.</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.295" end="00:51:15.315" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.535" end="00:51:20.555" style="s2">[screaming and groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.425" end="00:51:28.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop stabbing THEM. YOU&#39;RE MAKING THEM</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.925" end="00:51:28.525" style="s2">WORSE.</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.425" end="00:51:50.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LOWER YOUR SPEARS.</p>
<p begin="00:51:52.125" end="00:51:56.025" style="s2">They went around you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.925" end="00:51:59.425" style="s2">Every one of them went around you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.025" end="00:51:59.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe they know something you don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.125" end="00:52:07.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Same leg.</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.025" end="00:52:07.725" style="s2">Same wound.</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.825" end="00:52:26.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara Velle. Who&#39;s that?</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.225" end="00:52:28.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one you need to know.</p>
<p begin="00:52:26.925" end="00:52:32.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You circled her name.</p>
<p begin="00:52:28.625" end="00:52:34.125" style="s2">People don&#39;t circle no one.</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.025" end="00:52:37.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My sister.</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.125" end="00:52:37.325" style="s2">The book says monsters took her.</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.325" end="00:52:45.825" style="s2">You saved a man who&#39;s hunting you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.325" end="00:52:46.525" style="s2">That&#39;s a stupid thing to do.</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.825" end="00:52:48.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.525" end="00:52:50.125" style="s2">Bad habit.</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.225" end="00:52:51.125" style="s2">Where&#39;s Wick, the blind smith? Is he</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.125" end="00:52:52.325" style="s2">alive?</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.125" end="00:52:56.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s alive.</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.325" end="00:52:56.125" style="s2">Kesh wants him alive. Ask yourself why.</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.025" end="00:53:01.625" style="s2">I owe you a life.</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.625" end="00:53:01.625" style="s2">I don&#39;t forget debts.</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.325" end="00:53:07.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then don&#39;t follow us.</p>
<p begin="00:53:18.627" end="00:53:23.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Captain, what do we tell the warden?</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.227" end="00:53:26.227" style="s2">That we found nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.327" end="00:53:26.227" style="s2">Nothing but blight.</p>
<p begin="00:53:41.027" end="00:53:44.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:53:42.527" end="00:53:45.627" style="s2">It&#39;s tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.527" end="00:53:47.127" style="s2">The big one.</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.627" end="00:53:48.527" style="s2">Grave mouse.</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.127" end="00:53:50.127" style="s2">Its scar is right in the middle of its</p>
<p begin="00:53:48.527" end="00:53:52.527" style="s2">chest. It looked at the scale like it</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.127" end="00:53:52.527" style="s2">knew it.</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.027" end="00:53:59.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sit closer.</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.427" end="00:53:59.927" style="s2">I&#39;m only going to say this once.</p>
<p begin="00:54:04.227" end="00:54:08.827" style="s2">The coloring works like this.</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.327" end="00:54:11.027" style="s2">Soldiers catch a bonded pair. They chain</p>
<p begin="00:54:08.827" end="00:54:14.327" style="s2">the dragon. They drive a black spear</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.027" end="00:54:17.527" style="s2">into it. The human bleeds too. The bond</p>
<p begin="00:54:14.327" end="00:54:20.027" style="s2">snaps. The dragon goes mad. It breaks</p>
<p begin="00:54:17.527" end="00:54:22.327" style="s2">loose. It kills whoever&#39;s near. And the</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.027" end="00:54:23.927" style="s2">next morning, the city hears a monster</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.327" end="00:54:25.527" style="s2">struck again.</p>
<p begin="00:54:23.927" end="00:54:27.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 15 years ago,</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.527" end="00:54:29.927" style="s2">a cliff in the rain,</p>
<p begin="00:54:27.827" end="00:54:31.127" style="s2">there was a dragon on the ground,</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.927" end="00:54:32.327" style="s2">a blue one,</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.127" end="00:54:35.027" style="s2">steel blue,</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.327" end="00:54:35.027" style="s2">and a spear.</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.327" end="00:54:40.927" style="s2">Then the monster that took my mother</p>
<p begin="00:54:38.727" end="00:54:44.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; was her dragon.</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.927" end="00:54:44.827" style="s2">His name was Caldris.</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.627" end="00:54:50.627" style="s2">He didn&#39;t take her to kill her.</p>
<p begin="00:54:48.927" end="00:54:53.927" style="s2">He took her because she was the last</p>
<p begin="00:54:50.627" end="00:54:53.927" style="s2">thing he still knew.</p>
<p begin="00:54:55.827" end="00:54:59.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve been afraid of him my whole life.</p>
<p begin="00:55:13.683" end="00:55:15.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.728" end="00:55:30.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She told me to hide my hands.</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.828" end="00:55:30.028" style="s2">She knew they&#39;d come for me, too.</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.528" end="00:55:35.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was protecting the last thing she</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.928" end="00:55:35.328" style="s2">had.</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.128" end="00:55:44.628" style="s2">Elara&#39;s crest</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.828" end="00:55:46.228" style="s2">and Caldris carried that bag.</p>
<p begin="00:55:44.628" end="00:55:48.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The egg was inside.</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.228" end="00:55:49.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then it was his last egg.</p>
<p begin="00:55:48.128" end="00:55:51.828" style="s2">She must have hidden it before they</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.328" end="00:55:51.828" style="s2">caught her.</p>
<p begin="00:55:53.628" end="00:55:59.328" style="s2">Bonded blood woke him. Your mother&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.828" end="00:56:00.728" style="s2">blood in you. He&#39;s Caldris&#39;s son.</p>
<p begin="00:55:59.328" end="00:56:02.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s why Grave Moth looked at him like</p>
<p begin="00:56:00.728" end="00:56:02.928" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.028" end="00:56:09.728" style="s2">Is she alive? My mother, tell me the</p>
<p begin="00:56:07.328" end="00:56:09.728" style="s2">truth.</p>
<p begin="00:56:10.228" end="00:56:15.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A blight only circles what it lost if</p>
<p begin="00:56:12.728" end="00:56:17.928" style="s2">that thing is still breathing.</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.728" end="00:56:21.628" style="s2">Grave Moth has circled your city every</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.928" end="00:56:21.628" style="s2">night for 15 years.</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.128" end="00:56:25.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s in the city.</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.928" end="00:56:28.428" style="s2">She&#39;s alive and she&#39;s in the city.</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.628" end="00:56:30.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Somewhere Kesh can keep her, somewhere</p>
<p begin="00:56:28.428" end="00:56:30.828" style="s2">deep.</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.328" end="00:56:34.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I am going back.</p>
<p begin="00:56:40.828" end="00:56:44.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:56:43.228" end="00:56:46.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move.</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.728" end="00:56:48.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s waiting for you.</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.628" end="00:56:51.628" style="s2">That&#39;s why the old man is still</p>
<p begin="00:56:48.128" end="00:56:53.128" style="s2">breathing. You walk in, you both die.</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.628" end="00:56:57.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what?</p>
<p begin="00:56:53.128" end="00:56:57.028" style="s2">I sit in a cave while he rots?</p>
<p begin="00:57:21.529" end="00:57:26.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The old man dies in three days. It&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.429" end="00:57:28.229" style="s2">trap. It&#39;s signed I.</p>
<p begin="00:57:26.829" end="00:57:33.199" style="s2">Idris.</p>
<p begin="00:57:28.229" end="00:57:35.219" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A hunter warning his prey. Interesting.</p>
<p begin="00:57:33.199" end="00:57:35.219" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.729" end="00:57:43.679" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sail said the wells breathe out</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.829" end="00:57:45.699" style="s2">somewhere down here. Find the heat.</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.679" end="00:57:45.699" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:57:51.539" end="00:57:53.559" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.529" end="00:58:18.329" style="s2">Quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:58:15.529" end="00:58:18.329" style="s2">Scales are loud.</p>
<p begin="00:58:29.929" end="00:58:32.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t panic.</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.280" end="00:59:04.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.551" end="00:59:26.571" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.931" end="00:59:43.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The wells never go cold.</p>
<p begin="00:59:43.331" end="00:59:48.231" style="s2">Every night I warm my hands on them.</p>
<p begin="00:59:45.331" end="00:59:48.231" style="s2">Every single night.</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.131" end="01:00:27.531" style="s2">I see you. I&#39;ll come back. I swear I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:00:25.131" end="01:00:27.531" style="s2">come back.</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.031" end="01:00:46.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Smells [snorts] like fresh smoke down</p>
<p begin="01:00:44.231" end="01:00:49.031" style="s2">here. It&#39;s a furnace full of dragons. It</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.031" end="01:00:49.031" style="s2">always smells like smoke.</p>
<p begin="01:00:54.331" end="01:00:57.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:00:55.831" end="01:00:59.531" style="s2">I should have said something.</p>
<p begin="01:00:57.531" end="01:01:00.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then they&#39;d have two of us.</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.531" end="01:01:03.931" style="s2">Go on.</p>
<p begin="01:01:00.831" end="01:01:03.931" style="s2">Find who you came for.</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.832" end="01:01:21.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:01:24.417" end="01:01:26.437" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.997" end="01:01:51.832" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.432" end="01:01:54.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fire pit and goat.</p>
<p begin="01:01:51.832" end="01:01:58.832" style="s2">You came back, you idiot.</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.532" end="01:01:58.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said not to, so I had to.</p>
<p begin="01:02:00.932" end="01:02:05.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, stop. Listen to me first.</p>
<p begin="01:02:05.332" end="01:02:09.732" style="s2">She&#39;s here, Tam.</p>
<p begin="01:02:07.032" end="01:02:12.132" style="s2">Two cages down. I hear her cough every</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.732" end="01:02:12.132" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="01:02:12.732" end="01:02:17.032" style="s2">Your mother&#39;s here. She&#39;s alive.</p>
<p begin="01:02:19.632" end="01:02:23.832" style="s2">Go on.</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.132" end="01:02:23.832" style="s2">Go on, girl.</p>
<p begin="01:02:46.432" end="01:02:48.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama?</p>
<p begin="01:02:51.632" end="01:02:54.332" style="s2">Tamzin?</p>
<p begin="01:03:06.432" end="01:03:10.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you to hide them.</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.832" end="01:03:13.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did.</p>
<p begin="01:03:10.032" end="01:03:13.232" style="s2">15 years I did.</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.033" end="01:03:24.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He has his father&#39;s eyes.</p>
<p begin="01:03:25.933" end="01:03:29.333" style="s2">The monster took you. I saw that much.</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.933" end="01:03:30.933" style="s2">How are you here?</p>
<p begin="01:03:29.333" end="01:03:32.933" style="s2">He flew me to his nest. He didn&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.933" end="01:03:34.333" style="s2">me anymore, but he kept me warm.</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.933" end="01:03:35.833" style="s2">Kesh&#39;s soldiers found the nest a month</p>
<p begin="01:03:34.333" end="01:03:38.033" style="s2">later. They took me back while he was</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.833" end="01:03:39.233" style="s2">hunting. Why keep you alive? Because as</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.033" end="01:03:41.533" style="s2">long as I&#39;m breathing down here,</p>
<p begin="01:03:39.233" end="01:03:44.933" style="s2">Caldarius never leaves this city.</p>
<p begin="01:03:41.533" end="01:03:44.933" style="s2">Kesh likes a monster on a chain.</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.533" end="01:03:51.433" style="s2">Same place as his.</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.133" end="01:04:00.733" style="s2">I&#39;m getting you out. You and Wick</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.333" end="01:04:00.733" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.733" end="01:04:06.333" style="s2">Stop.</p>
<p begin="01:04:04.933" end="01:04:07.433" style="s2">That&#39;s what he wants.</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.333" end="01:04:09.933" style="s2">Why do you think there are no guards on</p>
<p begin="01:04:07.433" end="01:04:09.933" style="s2">this row?</p>
<p begin="01:04:15.533" end="01:04:17.933" style="s2">Look up.</p>
<p begin="01:04:40.133" end="01:04:45.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told them you&#39;d come for the old man.</p>
<p begin="01:04:43.539" end="01:04:45.559" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.933" end="01:04:56.633" style="s2">I didn&#39;t tell them you&#39;d find her, too.</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.633" end="01:04:56.633" style="s2">That&#39;s a gift.</p>
<p begin="01:05:01.933" end="01:05:05.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; TURN. [screaming] RUN!</p>
<p begin="01:05:40.635" end="01:05:47.075" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Caldoris&#39;s son, of course. I should have</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.135" end="01:05:49.095" style="s2">burned that egg myself.</p>
<p begin="01:05:47.075" end="01:05:49.095" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:05:51.735" end="01:05:55.035" style="s2">Show me your hands.</p>
<p begin="01:05:56.735" end="01:05:59.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:05:58.035" end="01:06:01.835" style="s2">Don&#39;t show him.</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.835" end="01:06:04.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your mother hid hers too.</p>
<p begin="01:06:01.835" end="01:06:04.635" style="s2">It didn&#39;t help her.</p>
<p begin="01:06:05.235" end="01:06:08.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You did this, all of it. The cliff, the</p>
<p begin="01:06:07.235" end="01:06:10.835" style="s2">blight, the wells.</p>
<p begin="01:06:08.635" end="01:06:14.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I kept your city warm and your kind</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.835" end="01:06:16.535" style="s2">alive. You&#39;re welcome.</p>
<p begin="01:06:14.335" end="01:06:19.735" style="s2">Step aside, child.</p>
<p begin="01:06:16.535" end="01:06:19.735" style="s2">You don&#39;t belong to her.</p>
<p begin="01:06:27.635" end="01:06:31.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ORATH, NO, COME BACK.</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.035" end="01:06:48.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BRAVE,</p>
<p begin="01:06:46.535" end="01:06:52.435" style="s2">like your father.</p>
<p begin="01:06:48.735" end="01:06:52.435" style="s2">He bled for her too.</p>
<p begin="01:07:13.635" end="01:07:16.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tam? Where are you? You&#39;re bleeding. I</p>
<p begin="01:07:16.135" end="01:07:17.735" style="s2">can smell it.</p>
<p begin="01:07:16.935" end="01:07:20.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here.</p>
<p begin="01:07:17.735" end="01:07:20.135" style="s2">I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="01:07:26.636" end="01:07:28.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="01:07:36.836" end="01:07:41.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep talking, girl.</p>
<p begin="01:07:38.536" end="01:07:45.136" style="s2">Keep talking so I know where you are.</p>
<p begin="01:07:41.036" end="01:07:45.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wick, Wick, no. Wick.</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.692" end="01:08:21.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [crying]</p>
<p begin="01:08:25.587" end="01:08:27.607" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:08:29.136" end="01:08:34.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Told you</p>
<p begin="01:08:31.336" end="01:08:34.436" style="s2">not to come back.</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.536" end="01:08:37.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You always say the opposite.</p>
<p begin="01:08:40.836" end="01:08:46.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then</p>
<p begin="01:08:42.536" end="01:08:46.136" style="s2">don&#39;t hide your hands, Tam.</p>
<p begin="01:08:57.036" end="01:09:03.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring me the girl.</p>
<p begin="01:08:59.136" end="01:09:03.336" style="s2">Put the mother back in her cage.</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.136" end="01:09:16.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too much at once</p>
<p begin="01:09:14.536" end="01:09:19.736" style="s2">and it nearly kills you. Orif, DON&#39;T.</p>
<p begin="01:09:16.936" end="01:09:19.736" style="s2">IT&#39;S TOO MUCH.</p>
<p begin="01:09:28.036" end="01:09:29.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; TAM&#39;S IN</p>
<p begin="01:09:28.938" end="01:09:32.338" style="s2">GET OUT.</p>
<p begin="01:09:29.938" end="01:09:32.338" style="s2">Leave me.</p>
<p begin="01:09:43.038" end="01:09:48.773" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alive.</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.038" end="01:09:50.793" style="s2">I want her hands, not her corpse.</p>
<p begin="01:09:48.773" end="01:09:50.793" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="01:10:01.938" end="01:10:05.038" style="s2">Get away from that.</p>
<p begin="01:10:11.698" end="01:10:13.718" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.938" end="01:11:04.938" style="s2">You ate the city&#39;s fire. Do you know</p>
<p begin="01:11:02.137" end="01:11:04.938" style="s2">what you&#39;ve done?</p>
<p begin="01:11:08.738" end="01:11:11.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get us out</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.137" end="01:11:13.738" style="s2">up</p>
<p begin="01:11:11.137" end="01:11:13.738" style="s2">through the roof.</p>
<p begin="01:11:35.539" end="01:11:39.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The wells.</p>
<p begin="01:11:36.939" end="01:11:39.839" style="s2">The wells went cold.</p>
<p begin="01:11:57.239" end="01:12:01.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll come back for you.</p>
<p begin="01:11:58.939" end="01:12:01.439" style="s2">I swear.</p>
<p begin="01:12:29.239" end="01:12:31.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama!</p>
<p begin="01:12:29.905" end="01:12:31.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.539" end="01:12:36.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go.</p>
<p begin="01:12:55.450" end="01:12:57.470" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:13:00.690" end="01:13:02.710" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="01:13:26.236" end="01:13:28.256" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:13:34.740" end="01:13:38.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Warden,</p>
<p begin="01:13:35.640" end="01:13:40.440" style="s2">the wells are dark. The whole city.</p>
<p begin="01:13:38.140" end="01:13:44.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then the city will be cold.</p>
<p begin="01:13:40.440" end="01:13:44.740" style="s2">And cold people need someone to blame.</p>
<p begin="01:14:06.640" end="01:14:09.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take us to Sale.</p>
<p begin="01:14:24.940" end="01:14:28.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you two do?</p>
<p begin="01:14:28.461" end="01:14:30.481" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:14:35.840" end="01:14:40.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wick&#39;s dead.</p>
<p begin="01:14:37.040" end="01:14:40.840" style="s2">Mum is alive. The wells are dark.</p>
<p begin="01:14:58.640" end="01:15:04.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He never once let me see him scared.</p>
<p begin="01:15:01.640" end="01:15:04.240" style="s2">Not once.</p>
<p begin="01:15:06.040" end="01:15:13.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Blind men can&#39;t see fire coming.</p>
<p begin="01:15:09.640" end="01:15:13.240" style="s2">He walked into it anyway.</p>
<p begin="01:15:14.312" end="01:15:16.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:15:37.542" end="01:15:40.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You healed.</p>
<p begin="01:15:39.142" end="01:15:43.542" style="s2">I didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.542" end="01:15:43.542" style="s2">Fair trade, I guess.</p>
<p begin="01:15:54.442" end="01:16:00.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Humans broke into the Hollow last night.</p>
<p begin="01:15:57.342" end="01:16:03.442" style="s2">Humans put out your wells. [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:16:00.842" end="01:16:06.342" style="s2">They hide in Ashfen with the blight,</p>
<p begin="01:16:03.442" end="01:16:08.542" style="s2">with their bonded beast. At dawn, light</p>
<p begin="01:16:06.342" end="01:16:11.542" style="s2">the marsh.</p>
<p begin="01:16:08.542" end="01:16:11.542" style="s2">Drive them out.</p>
<p begin="01:16:30.642" end="01:16:35.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;d like to keep your eyes, both of</p>
<p begin="01:16:32.842" end="01:16:35.142" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="01:16:36.342" end="01:16:41.142" style="s2">And at dawn, the woman dies on the cliff</p>
<p begin="01:16:39.142" end="01:16:42.842" style="s2">where her dragon broke.</p>
<p begin="01:16:41.142" end="01:16:45.042" style="s2">Her daughter will come</p>
<p begin="01:16:42.842" end="01:16:47.442" style="s2">and I&#39;ll finish what I began 15 years</p>
<p begin="01:16:45.042" end="01:16:47.442" style="s2">ago.</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.542" end="01:17:05.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t look afraid.</p>
<p begin="01:17:03.342" end="01:17:07.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve been afraid for 15 years. I&#39;m done</p>
<p begin="01:17:05.542" end="01:17:07.842" style="s2">with it.</p>
<p begin="01:17:28.542" end="01:17:32.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those are the signal horns.</p>
<p begin="01:17:30.842" end="01:17:34.442" style="s2">He means to set the whole marsh alight</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.742" end="01:17:36.843" style="s2">at dawn.</p>
<p begin="01:17:34.442" end="01:17:38.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grave moths out there, Caldris too.</p>
<p begin="01:17:36.843" end="01:17:39.943" style="s2">They&#39;ll be trapped in it.</p>
<p begin="01:17:38.543" end="01:17:42.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And your mother?</p>
<p begin="01:17:39.943" end="01:17:44.743" style="s2">He&#39;ll keep her on that cliff. She&#39;s his</p>
<p begin="01:17:42.143" end="01:17:44.743" style="s2">bait now.</p>
<p begin="01:17:54.743" end="01:17:59.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sit down. You can barely stand.</p>
<p begin="01:17:57.843" end="01:18:01.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He picked the cliff for a reason.</p>
<p begin="01:17:59.643" end="01:18:02.343" style="s2">He wants me there.</p>
<p begin="01:18:01.343" end="01:18:05.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:18:02.343" end="01:18:05.343" style="s2">Then we go to the cliff.</p>
<p begin="01:18:27.543" end="01:18:30.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Orak!</p>
<p begin="01:18:29.243" end="01:18:32.179" style="s2">Wait!</p>
<p begin="01:18:30.159" end="01:18:32.179" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:18:35.399" end="01:18:37.419" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:18:37.743" end="01:18:40.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The hunter.</p>
<p begin="01:18:39.543" end="01:18:43.543" style="s2">Alone.</p>
<p begin="01:18:40.843" end="01:18:47.143" style="s2">Brave or very stupid.</p>
<p begin="01:18:43.543" end="01:18:47.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mostly stupid lately.</p>
<p begin="01:19:01.743" end="01:19:04.643" style="s2">I didn&#39;t come to fight.</p>
<p begin="01:19:03.343" end="01:19:05.743" style="s2">I came to tell you what&#39;s on that cliff</p>
<p begin="01:19:04.643" end="01:19:07.543" style="s2">at dawn.</p>
<p begin="01:19:05.743" end="01:19:08.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know what&#39;s on that cliff.</p>
<p begin="01:19:07.543" end="01:19:10.543" style="s2">My mother.</p>
<p begin="01:19:08.743" end="01:19:12.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And 40 soldiers.</p>
<p begin="01:19:10.543" end="01:19:14.843" style="s2">And the council.</p>
<p begin="01:19:12.043" end="01:19:14.843" style="s2">And Kesh himself.</p>
<p begin="01:19:26.743" end="01:19:29.143" style="s2">My sister.</p>
<p begin="01:19:27.943" end="01:19:30.443" style="s2">Mara.</p>
<p begin="01:19:29.143" end="01:19:31.943" style="s2">She was bonded.</p>
<p begin="01:19:30.443" end="01:19:33.643" style="s2">I didn&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="01:19:31.943" end="01:19:35.243" style="s2">They told us monsters took her.</p>
<p begin="01:19:33.643" end="01:19:36.843" style="s2">I believed them. I wrote her name in</p>
<p begin="01:19:35.243" end="01:19:38.943" style="s2">this book myself.</p>
<p begin="01:19:36.843" end="01:19:42.945" style="s2">That mark means culling.</p>
<p begin="01:19:38.943" end="01:19:45.144" style="s2">I signed that list, 12 years of names.</p>
<p begin="01:19:42.945" end="01:19:47.945" style="s2">She made this for me when we were kids.</p>
<p begin="01:19:45.144" end="01:19:47.945" style="s2">That&#39;s why I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="01:19:49.344" end="01:19:52.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You hunted me.</p>
<p begin="01:19:51.045" end="01:19:53.644" style="s2">You took Wick.</p>
<p begin="01:19:52.545" end="01:19:54.744" style="s2">Wick is dead.</p>
<p begin="01:19:53.644" end="01:19:57.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did.</p>
<p begin="01:19:54.744" end="01:19:59.045" style="s2">I hunted you. I took him.</p>
<p begin="01:19:57.844" end="01:20:00.744" style="s2">And I&#39;m done.</p>
<p begin="01:19:59.045" end="01:20:04.144" style="s2">You can hate me tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:20:00.744" end="01:20:04.144" style="s2">Tonight I can open those chains.</p>
<p begin="01:20:15.045" end="01:20:17.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which chains?</p>
<p begin="01:20:24.045" end="01:20:27.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Hollow. 40 dragons in chains. Kesh</p>
<p begin="01:20:26.644" end="01:20:29.445" style="s2">pulled every guard up to the cliff for</p>
<p begin="01:20:27.844" end="01:20:30.945" style="s2">the execution.</p>
<p begin="01:20:29.445" end="01:20:33.445" style="s2">I know the Hollow. I know where the</p>
<p begin="01:20:30.945" end="01:20:37.045" style="s2">chain locks are. I can open the chains.</p>
<p begin="01:20:33.445" end="01:20:38.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 40 starved dragons, angry ones.</p>
<p begin="01:20:37.045" end="01:20:40.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="01:20:38.244" end="01:20:40.945" style="s2">Angry at him.</p>
<p begin="01:20:44.545" end="01:20:49.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; While he&#39;s watching the cliff, nobody&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:20:46.445" end="01:20:50.844" style="s2">watching the Hollow.</p>
<p begin="01:20:49.144" end="01:20:53.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then here&#39;s the plan.</p>
<p begin="01:20:50.844" end="01:20:56.244" style="s2">Hunter, you go down the hole Orith made</p>
<p begin="01:20:53.445" end="01:20:58.545" style="s2">and open every chain. I go with you and</p>
<p begin="01:20:56.244" end="01:21:00.844" style="s2">lead them up. They&#39;ll follow a dragon.</p>
<p begin="01:20:58.545" end="01:21:03.045" style="s2">They won&#39;t follow a human. And you two</p>
<p begin="01:21:00.844" end="01:21:03.644" style="s2">go to the cliff. Keep Kesh looking at</p>
<p begin="01:21:03.045" end="01:21:05.144" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:21:03.644" end="01:21:06.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep him looking at me?</p>
<p begin="01:21:05.144" end="01:21:07.445" style="s2">I can do that.</p>
<p begin="01:21:06.045" end="01:21:08.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;ll try to kill you through him with</p>
<p begin="01:21:07.445" end="01:21:09.744" style="s2">the black spell. That&#39;s how the clubbing</p>
<p begin="01:21:08.945" end="01:21:12.945" style="s2">works.</p>
<p begin="01:21:09.744" end="01:21:12.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then he&#39;ll have to get close.</p>
<p begin="01:21:14.244" end="01:21:18.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sunrise, not a moment later.</p>
<p begin="01:21:30.941" end="01:21:34.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="01:21:32.144" end="01:21:38.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chain locks are old iron.</p>
<p begin="01:21:34.144" end="01:21:38.445" style="s2">This breaks old iron. He made it.</p>
<p begin="01:21:43.344" end="01:21:47.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll bring it back.</p>
<p begin="01:21:45.745" end="01:21:50.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring yourself back.</p>
<p begin="01:21:47.546" end="01:21:50.046" style="s2">That&#39;s harder.</p>
<p begin="01:22:29.245" end="01:22:34.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Same rock, same frame.</p>
<p begin="01:22:32.345" end="01:22:37.745" style="s2">15 years and you&#39;ve come all the way</p>
<p begin="01:22:34.546" end="01:22:40.646" style="s2">back to where you broke.</p>
<p begin="01:22:37.745" end="01:22:42.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t break. Caldaras did. You made</p>
<p begin="01:22:40.646" end="01:22:42.845" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="01:22:49.245" end="01:22:52.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her name was Izra,</p>
<p begin="01:22:50.946" end="01:22:54.245" style="s2">a shepherd.</p>
<p begin="01:22:52.345" end="01:22:56.546" style="s2">She used to sing to sheep</p>
<p begin="01:22:54.245" end="01:22:59.146" style="s2">badly.</p>
<p begin="01:22:56.546" end="01:23:03.345" style="s2">Men from the valley came for our gold,</p>
<p begin="01:22:59.146" end="01:23:05.245" style="s2">one arrow through her throat.</p>
<p begin="01:23:03.345" end="01:23:06.646" style="s2">I felt it go in</p>
<p begin="01:23:05.245" end="01:23:09.546" style="s2">here,</p>
<p begin="01:23:06.646" end="01:23:11.845" style="s2">and I felt the bond start to tear,</p>
<p begin="01:23:09.546" end="01:23:14.446" style="s2">the madness coming up my throat like</p>
<p begin="01:23:11.845" end="01:23:14.446" style="s2">fire.</p>
<p begin="01:23:19.646" end="01:23:24.046" style="s2">So I turned my fire on myself, right</p>
<p begin="01:23:22.046" end="01:23:26.146" style="s2">where the bond lived. I burned it out</p>
<p begin="01:23:24.046" end="01:23:28.446" style="s2">before it could finish. It took a year</p>
<p begin="01:23:26.146" end="01:23:30.446" style="s2">to stop screaming, but I never became</p>
<p begin="01:23:28.446" end="01:23:32.946" style="s2">one of those things.</p>
<p begin="01:23:30.446" end="01:23:34.546" style="s2">Every bond is a leash your kind can cut.</p>
<p begin="01:23:32.946" end="01:23:37.845" style="s2">I cut them first.</p>
<p begin="01:23:34.546" end="01:23:40.745" style="s2">I saved dragons from your kind.</p>
<p begin="01:23:37.845" end="01:23:40.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t save them.</p>
<p begin="01:23:41.245" end="01:23:45.547" style="s2">You did to every dragon what that did to</p>
<p begin="01:23:43.247" end="01:23:45.547" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:23:50.047" end="01:23:53.747" style="s2">You chained them under your city and</p>
<p begin="01:23:51.647" end="01:23:57.447" style="s2">drank their fire.</p>
<p begin="01:23:53.747" end="01:24:00.947" style="s2">You made monsters and called it peace.</p>
<p begin="01:23:57.447" end="01:24:00.947" style="s2">Istra would be ashamed of you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:28.047" end="01:24:34.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not for you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:30.047" end="01:24:34.047" style="s2">For the dragon she brings.</p>
<p begin="01:24:35.047" end="01:24:40.047" style="s2">Call your monster, Elara.</p>
<p begin="01:24:37.947" end="01:24:43.647" style="s2">Let it watch.</p>
<p begin="01:24:40.047" end="01:24:43.647" style="s2">Let them all watch.</p>
<p begin="01:25:04.347" end="01:25:08.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:25:05.647" end="01:25:08.847" style="s2">No, baby. Turn around.</p>
<p begin="01:25:11.747" end="01:25:15.747" style="s2">Straight at him. Make him look at us.</p>
<p begin="01:25:28.709" end="01:25:30.729" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:25:34.347" end="01:25:37.547" style="s2">Up.</p>
<p begin="01:25:35.347" end="01:25:37.547" style="s2">Go up.</p>
<p begin="01:26:01.948" end="01:26:06.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t kill them. They&#39;re not the ones</p>
<p begin="01:26:03.649" end="01:26:06.149" style="s2">who did it.</p>
<p begin="01:26:13.904" end="01:26:15.924" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:26:29.624" end="01:26:31.448" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:26:30.280" end="01:26:33.249" style="s2">[snorts] I&#39;m okay.</p>
<p begin="01:26:31.448" end="01:26:35.849" style="s2">I&#39;m okay.</p>
<p begin="01:26:33.249" end="01:26:35.849" style="s2">Keep going.</p>
<p begin="01:26:44.034" end="01:26:46.054" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:26:58.849" end="01:27:04.448" style="s2">I scraped your scales for five years.</p>
<p begin="01:27:01.249" end="01:27:04.448" style="s2">Are you going to stop me too?</p>
<p begin="01:27:24.645" end="01:27:26.665" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting and sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:27:39.710" end="01:27:41.730" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:27:45.605" end="01:27:47.625" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:27:59.361" end="01:28:01.381" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:28:02.250" end="01:28:05.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re free.</p>
<p begin="01:28:03.550" end="01:28:06.450" style="s2">Go on. Get up.</p>
<p begin="01:28:05.550" end="01:28:07.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Up,</p>
<p begin="01:28:06.450" end="01:28:10.750" style="s2">all of you.</p>
<p begin="01:28:07.950" end="01:28:13.250" style="s2">The one who chained you is standing on a</p>
<p begin="01:28:10.750" end="01:28:13.250" style="s2">cliff.</p>
<p begin="01:28:18.356" end="01:28:20.376" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:28:24.950" end="01:28:32.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Caldris&#39;s son,</p>
<p begin="01:28:27.750" end="01:28:32.850" style="s2">wearing Caldris&#39;s colors on his eyes.</p>
<p begin="01:28:33.750" end="01:28:38.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let her go. You want me? Here I am.</p>
<p begin="01:28:37.250" end="01:28:39.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tamsin,</p>
<p begin="01:28:38.350" end="01:28:41.150" style="s2">no.</p>
<p begin="01:28:39.250" end="01:28:45.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want you.</p>
<p begin="01:28:41.150" end="01:28:45.250" style="s2">I want what&#39;s inside you to stop.</p>
<p begin="01:28:45.750" end="01:28:49.350" style="s2">Light the marsh. Let her come.</p>
<p begin="01:29:43.507" end="01:29:45.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:29:55.651" end="01:30:00.251" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BLEAT.</p>
<p begin="01:29:56.751" end="01:30:00.251" style="s2">THE WHOLE MARSH IS COMING.</p>
<p begin="01:30:05.122" end="01:30:07.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:30:28.851" end="01:30:33.151" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU CAME.</p>
<p begin="01:30:30.251" end="01:30:33.151" style="s2">YOU ALWAYS CAME.</p>
<p begin="01:30:34.751" end="01:30:40.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THERE IT IS.</p>
<p begin="01:30:36.251" end="01:30:40.552" style="s2">My leash and my monster.</p>
<p begin="01:30:44.251" end="01:30:48.951" style="s2">Watch closely, Caldoris.</p>
<p begin="01:30:46.651" end="01:30:51.552" style="s2">This is the last thing you&#39;ll ever see</p>
<p begin="01:30:48.951" end="01:30:51.552" style="s2">clearly.</p>
<p begin="01:31:14.251" end="01:31:17.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="01:31:15.751" end="01:31:19.951" style="s2">I know you don&#39;t know me.</p>
<p begin="01:31:17.351" end="01:31:19.951" style="s2">It&#39;s all right.</p>
<p begin="01:31:32.751" end="01:31:38.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Free her if you like.</p>
<p begin="01:31:34.851" end="01:31:38.751" style="s2">She&#39;ll still be dead by noon.</p>
<p begin="01:32:12.052" end="01:32:14.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mara.</p>
<p begin="01:32:13.552" end="01:32:17.752" style="s2">Look.</p>
<p begin="01:32:14.952" end="01:32:17.752" style="s2">Look what we&#39;re doing.</p>
<p begin="01:32:32.552" end="01:32:35.153" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Captain.</p>
<p begin="01:32:33.552" end="01:32:36.452" style="s2">Captain, what are you doing?</p>
<p begin="01:32:35.153" end="01:32:38.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My job</p>
<p begin="01:32:36.452" end="01:32:40.414" style="s2">for once.</p>
<p begin="01:32:38.394" end="01:32:40.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:32:46.752" end="01:32:50.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hunter, let go and come.</p>
<p begin="01:32:56.852" end="01:33:01.252" style="s2">GO! GO! [screaming] GET THEM OUT!</p>
<p begin="01:33:32.052" end="01:33:34.724" style="s2">TO THE CLIFF!</p>
<p begin="01:33:33.552" end="01:33:36.744" style="s2">TO CASH!</p>
<p begin="01:33:34.724" end="01:33:36.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:34:11.405" end="01:34:13.425" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:34:20.354" end="01:34:23.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Same rock,</p>
<p begin="01:34:22.054" end="01:34:25.554" style="s2">same spear,</p>
<p begin="01:34:23.954" end="01:34:27.954" style="s2">same ending.</p>
<p begin="01:34:25.554" end="01:34:27.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:34:44.354" end="01:34:48.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now watch him forget you.</p>
<p begin="01:34:57.154" end="01:35:00.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:34:58.154" end="01:35:03.154" style="s2">No, look at me, Ortax.</p>
<p begin="01:35:00.754" end="01:35:03.154" style="s2">Look at me.</p>
<p begin="01:35:10.154" end="01:35:15.054" style="s2">Tamsin,</p>
<p begin="01:35:11.354" end="01:35:15.054" style="s2">your hand. Have a wound.</p>
<p begin="01:35:26.731" end="01:35:28.751" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:35:37.454" end="01:35:41.754" style="s2">It&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="01:35:39.154" end="01:35:41.754" style="s2">It&#39;s still me.</p>
<p begin="01:35:50.754" end="01:35:55.354" style="s2">Half and half.</p>
<p begin="01:35:53.554" end="01:35:57.754" style="s2">You and me.</p>
<p begin="01:35:55.354" end="01:35:57.754" style="s2">Remember?</p>
<p begin="01:36:07.756" end="01:36:12.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A wound shared is half a wound.</p>
<p begin="01:36:16.511" end="01:36:18.531" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:36:37.055" end="01:36:41.356" style="s2">Told you.</p>
<p begin="01:36:38.856" end="01:36:41.356" style="s2">We match.</p>
<p begin="01:36:42.455" end="01:36:48.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not possible. It doesn&#39;t heal</p>
<p begin="01:36:44.555" end="01:36:48.656" style="s2">back. It never heals back.</p>
<p begin="01:36:52.455" end="01:36:57.955" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never heals back</p>
<p begin="01:36:54.756" end="01:36:57.955" style="s2">because nobody ever tried.</p>
<p begin="01:37:02.955" end="01:37:07.555" style="s2">15 years, Cal.</p>
<p begin="01:37:05.256" end="01:37:10.156" style="s2">Give me half, please.</p>
<p begin="01:37:07.555" end="01:37:10.156" style="s2">Just half.</p>
<p begin="01:37:27.756" end="01:37:33.955" style="s2">You took my eye.</p>
<p begin="01:37:30.455" end="01:37:33.955" style="s2">You don&#39;t get to watch this.</p>
<p begin="01:38:01.455" end="01:38:03.857" style="s2">There you are.</p>
<p begin="01:38:03.932" end="01:38:05.952" style="s2">[groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:38:18.556" end="01:38:22.357" style="s2">They remember who changed them.</p>
<p begin="01:38:26.858" end="01:38:28.878" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:38:35.556" end="01:38:39.958" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saved you.</p>
<p begin="01:38:37.556" end="01:38:41.978" style="s2">All of you.</p>
<p begin="01:38:39.958" end="01:38:41.978" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:38:58.156" end="01:39:00.757" style="s2">Ezra.</p>
<p begin="01:39:25.857" end="01:39:28.257" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama?</p>
<p begin="01:39:28.457" end="01:39:32.857" style="s2">I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="01:39:30.056" end="01:39:32.857" style="s2">I&#39;m right here.</p>
<p begin="01:39:40.656" end="01:39:45.457" style="s2">15 years.</p>
<p begin="01:39:42.457" end="01:39:45.457" style="s2">I&#39;m not letting go.</p>
<p begin="01:39:50.857" end="01:39:53.957" style="s2">Hey.</p>
<p begin="01:39:52.056" end="01:39:55.283" style="s2">You slept 3 days. You snore like your</p>
<p begin="01:39:53.957" end="01:39:57.303" style="s2">grandmother.</p>
<p begin="01:39:55.283" end="01:39:57.303" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:39:59.757" end="01:40:02.156" style="s2">15 years I prayed you&#39;d keep them</p>
<p begin="01:40:01.056" end="01:40:03.857" style="s2">hidden.</p>
<p begin="01:40:02.156" end="01:40:05.056" style="s2">And the one time you didn&#39;t, you saved</p>
<p begin="01:40:03.857" end="01:40:05.358" style="s2">all of us.</p>
<p begin="01:40:05.056" end="01:40:07.058" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wick</p>
<p begin="01:40:05.358" end="01:40:08.858" style="s2">&gt;&gt; told me not to hide them.</p>
<p begin="01:40:07.058" end="01:40:11.858" style="s2">Right at the end.</p>
<p begin="01:40:08.858" end="01:40:13.158" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He always knew better than both of us.</p>
<p begin="01:40:11.858" end="01:40:14.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s Orith?</p>
<p begin="01:40:13.158" end="01:40:17.558" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Outside.</p>
<p begin="01:40:14.358" end="01:40:17.558" style="s2">He hasn&#39;t moved in three days.</p>
<p begin="01:40:38.358" end="01:40:43.958" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Matching scars.</p>
<p begin="01:40:40.358" end="01:40:43.958" style="s2">Wick would say we look ridiculous.</p>
<p begin="01:41:10.458" end="01:41:13.858" style="s2">You still owe me for the ash pit.</p>
<p begin="01:41:35.858" end="01:41:40.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, old girl.</p>
<p begin="01:41:37.458" end="01:41:40.458" style="s2">I stopped hiding.</p>
<p begin="01:42:01.558" end="01:42:06.558" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You brought it back.</p>
<p begin="01:42:03.458" end="01:42:06.558" style="s2">You just didn&#39;t bring yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:42:22.359" end="01:42:25.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t even think about it.</p>
<p begin="01:42:33.159" end="01:42:38.381" style="s2">40 m of dragon,</p>
<p begin="01:42:35.559" end="01:42:40.259" style="s2">still a goat-smelling child.</p>
<p begin="01:42:38.381" end="01:42:43.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:42:40.259" end="01:42:43.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He learned from the best.</p>
